From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shawn-makes-stuff <shawn.rains@rocketmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:16:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/23] rusticc: the plugin layer mirrors COSMOS's klippy;
 drv8833 for python modules

Mirrors generated from the COSMOS reference (Kalico 5b59427 + COSMOS's
patches): its own modules (drv8833, hx711s, canvas_rfid,
canvas_filament_sensor) and the ones it patches (klippy APP_NAME,
queuelogger, thermistor), the existing IDs kept (gen_mirror.py BASE_IDS).
The native drv8833's drv8833_set_speed / drv8833_move / active / name for
python modules: the python AFC with an Elegoo Canvas runs on Rusticc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015j6wmNX3xANfteuEeqMb2L
